## Key Learnings
- Operational Excellence focuses on running and improving workloads efficiently.
- Telemetry helps monitor applications using metrics, logs, and events.
- KPIs measure workload performance.
- ORR ensures production readiness.
- URR ensures update readiness.
- Continuous improvement is a core AWS best practice.

